    {"symbol": "⚖️", "tooltip": "The power asymmetry — velocity and cost metrics outweigh maintainability concerns in every boardroom, tipping governance into theater."},
    {"symbol": "📉", "tooltip": "The degrading comprehension ratio — sprint over sprint, the team's ability to safely modify AI-generated code declines while dashboards stay green."}
